{"additions":429,"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"Closes #187\n\n## What\n\n- **`projects-roadmap { start \"<offset>\"; zoom \"<level>\" }`** (top-level, both children optional):\n  - `start` — the first visible day as an offset from today (`\"-7d\"`, `\"-2w\"`, `\"-1m\"`, `\"0d\"`; `d` / `w` / `m` = 30 days). Implemented as the timeline's *initial scroll* rather than a clipped origin, so items that begin earlier are still reachable with `h`, and `+` / `-` return to the configured start (`roadmap_scroll = None`).\n  - `zoom` — the initial scale (`month` / `week` / `day`), seeded whenever a view is applied (`apply_view` reset) and on `clear`.\n- **Per view** — a local `projects-view` can carry `roadmap { start; zoom }`; `RoadmapSettings::or` fills what the view leaves unset from `projects-roadmap`. `ProjectView.roadmap` is `#[serde(default)]` (disk-cache compatible; saved views have none).\n- Without the node nothing changes: earliest item, week scale.\n\n## Docs\n\nConfig Reference (en / ja): new `projects-roadmap` section with CI-verified examples, table row, unknown-block list, the `roadmap` child in `projects-view`; the Projects chapter's roadmap paragraph; README (en / ja); a commented example in `assets/default.kdl`. The Projects demo re-recorded (no key change).\n\n## Tests\n\n- `offsets_parse_in_days_weeks_and_months` (roadmap: offsets, `Zoom::parse`, `or`)\n- `projects_roadmap_default_override_and_validation` (loader: top-level + per-view + 6 error cases)\n- `roadmap_settings_seed_zoom_and_start` (board pane: config zoom, the view's zoom wins, the rendered initial scroll is 25 cells for a `-7d` start over items 30 days old, `h` scrolls left from there, a zoom change returns to the start)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w\n","changedFiles":15,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-10T07:11:18Z","deletions":19,"headRefName":"feat/projects-roadmap-range","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":190,"reviewDecision":"","reviewRequests":[],"reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABM8omvQ","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe configuration, runtime behavior, documentation, and tests appear consistent and the changes are well-scoped with validation and coverage for the new settings.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nAdds configurable default roadmap start position and zoom for the Projects page, wiring the settings through config loading, view overrides, runtime behavior, docs, and tests.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Introduces `projects-roadmap { start; zoom }` plus per-view `projects-view ... { roadmap { ... } }` overrides, with validation and merge support.\n- Updates the Projects roadmap rendering/interaction so roadmaps open at the configured start and zoom changes return to that configured start.\n- Refreshes documentation (EN/JA) and the Projects demo GIF; adds/extends tests for parsing/validation and pane behavior.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| src/projects/state.rs | Plumbs `projects-roadmap` config into the Projects board pane at initialization. |\r\n| src/projects/panes/board.rs | Implements roadmap default settings, initial-scroll behavior, and tests for start/zoom seeding and navigation. |\r\n| src/projects/domain/types.rs | Extends `ProjectView` with a serialized `roadmap` settings field (defaulted for cache compatibility). |\r\n| src/projects/domain/roadmap.rs | Adds `RoadmapSettings`, offset parsing, and config-string parsing for `Zoom` (serde-enabled). |\r\n| src/projects/domain/graphql.rs | Ensures GraphQL-derived views default the new `roadmap` field. |\r\n| src/core/config/merge.rs | Allows `projects-roadmap` as a replaceable top-level config block and updates unknown-block messaging. |\r\n| src/core/config/loader.rs | Parses/validates `projects-roadmap` and per-view `roadmap { ... }`, and adds loader tests. |\r\n| README.md | Documents `projects-roadmap` as affecting roadmap zoom/open position. |\r\n| docs/README.ja.md | Japanese README update mirroring the roadmap zoom/open position config note. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/views-projects.md | Explains default roadmap behavior and how `projects-roadmap` / per-view overrides affect it. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/config-reference.md | Adds full `projects-roadmap` reference section and notes per-view `roadmap` child. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/views-projects.md | Japanese guide update describing the new roadmap defaults and overrides. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/config-reference.md | Japanese config reference section for `projects-roadmap` and per-view overrides. |\r\n| assets/demo-projects.gif | Updates the recorded Projects demo GIF to reflect the new behavior/docs. |\r\n| assets/default.kdl | Adds a commented example and explanation for `projects-roadmap` and per-view overrides. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 15/15 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 0\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","submittedAt":"2026-09-10T07:14:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"bb089b7ab66aa462b679a1b3c74c941453d229b0"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-10T08:16:24Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34454266254/job/102796911525","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-09-10T08:16:32Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-10T07:15:40Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34448721081/job/102779227449","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-10T07:11:25Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-10T07:12:13Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34448721069/job/102779227172","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-09-10T07:11:35Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-10T07:14:29Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34448721081/job/102779227159","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-09-10T07:11:26Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-10T07:18:19Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34448721081/job/102779227541","name":"build (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-10T07:11:33Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-10T07:18:19Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34448721081/job/102781064338","name":"upload","startedAt":"2026-09-10T07:18:19Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-10T08:16:24Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34454266254/job/102796878230","name":"publish","startedAt":"2026-09-10T08:16:25Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-10T07:13:12Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34448721069/job/102779227451","name":"test (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-10T07:11:25Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-10T07:13:11Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34448721069/job/102779227385","name":"test (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-10T07:11:31Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-10T08:16:24Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34454266254/job/102796915597","name":"homebrew","startedAt":"2026-09-10T08:16:33Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"}],"title":"✨ Projects: configurable roadmap start and zoom (projects-roadmap)"}
